Subject: [PATCH 22/27] flashnext: the plan declaration, the dims const, the
 roce rule row and the split test flag are back

The first host-suite run caught four defects the lean gate cannot see: the grouped plan constant my
moeBlock edit displaced, cuda_tiles dims const my import insert replaced, the TF_ROCE_GID_INDEX row
my environment insert replaced, and the split-lane test fake pass without the new field.
---
 zig/src/families/flashnext/cuda_batch.zig           | 1 +
 zig/src/families/flashnext/cuda_split_lane_test.zig | 1 +
 zig/src/families/flashnext/cuda_tiles.zig           | 2 ++
 zig/src/platform/environment.zig                    | 1 +
 4 files changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/zig/src/families/flashnext/cuda_batch.zig b/zig/src/families/flashnext/cuda_batch.zig
index b3d8e43be..499e5654b 100644
--- a/zig/src/families/flashnext/cuda_batch.zig
+++ b/zig/src/families/flashnext/cuda_batch.zig
@@ -458,6 +458,7 @@ pub fn Pass(comptime Tri: type) type {
             try self.copy(keep.moe_ids, s.picks, pairs * 4);
             try self.copy(keep.moe_wts, s.wts, pairs * 4);
             const e = experts_n + 1;
+            const plan: cuda.grouped.Plan = .{ .members = s.members, .items = s.items, .counts = s.counts, .rank = s.rank, .hist = s.hist };
             if (lw.native_experts) |*native| return hc.moeRunPromptAware(self, native, n, pairs, plan, keep);
 
             if (n >= 64) {
